{"title":"NOBL Ethos SL MTB Wheelset is 1079g with Tape & Valves, and It’s Not Even Their Lightest","link":"https://bikerumor.com/nobl-ethos-sl-mtb-wheelset-is-1079g-with-tape-valves-and-its-not-even-their-lightest/","date":1791550860000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-10-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL rim\" /></p>\n<p>There’s no shortage of aftermarket wheels out there, so that’s forcing brands to figure out ways to stand out in the crowd. For NOBL, that means hand-building wheels in Cumberland, BC, for Canadian customers or in Bellingham, WA, for the Americans. While those wheels cover a wide range of disciplines and styles, NOBL seems to be planting its flag as a premier builder of ultra-lightweight wheels with the help of BERD spokes. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL wheel\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-12-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Wheels like the Ethos SL would certainly qualify. Which makes it even more amazing when you consider that these aren’t even the lightest that they offer. Built with a 29″ rim that measures 30mm internally and 20.5mm deep, the Ethos SL gets a pair of NOBL’s own TI70 hubs that were designed in conjunction with BERD and Erase Components out of Belgium. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL hub\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-4-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL hub\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-3-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL hub\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-5-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL freehub\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-8-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL hub\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-9-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The hubs are hooked so they offer a perfect mount for the looped BERD spoke ends and provide 5.14º of engagement. The Ti part of the name hints at the titanium freehub, and the 70 references the 70t ratchet. Hubs are offered in either 6-bolt or centerlock with HG, MicroSpline, or XD freehub options. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Each wheel is built with 28 <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/berd-launches-longer-spokes-for-32-xc-wheels-polylightx-extreme-downhill-spokes/\" target=\"_blank\">BERD Polylight Dyneema spokes</a> which loop around the hub and attach to a rim with standard Sapim Alloy Secure Lock nipples that thread onto the stainless steel threaded section bonded to the end of the spoke. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL spokes\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-6-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL valve\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-7-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-SL-rim-profile.png\"><img width=\"559\" height=\"340\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-SL-rim-profile.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-SL-rim-profile.png 559w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-SL-rim-profile-297x181.png 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-SL-rim-profile-120x73.png 120w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The BERD spokes are a big part of the lightweight story, but far from the only part. Compared to the NOBL Ethos XC wheelset, which is said to have a reinforced layup that is 21% stronger, the Ethos SL rims opt for an ultralight carbon layup with T800 and T1000 carbon fiber (and a 2mm taller rim profile than the XC rims). Calling them their lightest rim ever, the 270g SL rims are hookless with a 2.9mm-wide rim bead that’s angled and reinforced with a “flexible material” to make them more durable and impact-resistant.  </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL rear wheel weight\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL front wheel weight\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-2-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>On our scale with rim tape and NOBL’s own valve stems installed, the actual weights come out to 489g for the front and 590g for the rear. Just 1079g for the pair. If you need something lighter, the Ethos SL180 drops to a claimed 993g for the pair thanks to DT Swiss 180 hubs. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Unfortunately for us, by the time these wheels showed up, the bike I had intended to use them on had to go back, and the freehub wasn’t right for any other bike I had to test them on, so we didn’t get any time on them before the wheels themselves had to go back to NOBL. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-1536x1024.jpg\" alt=\"NOBL Ethos SL Wheelset\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/NOBL-Ethos-SL-MTB-wheelset-BERD-Spokes-actual-weight-13-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Overall, though, the NOBL Ethos SL wheels are a very interesting option if you’re looking for an insanely light set of 29″ wheels. Like the old adage goes, “light, strong, cheap, pick two…” you will definitely not find the Ethos SL to be cheap. The SLs sell for $2,399 for a set, with options for glossy white, gold, silver, and black decals included. The Ethos XC wheels are only $100 less for a 1,175g claimed weight, but with a stronger rim as mentioned. Or go the other way with the Ethos SL180s priced at $2,799. All NOBL rims include a lifetime warranty for the original owner, so long as it fails “while being used as intended.”</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://shop.noblwheels.com/shop/eth-sl-ti70-29-ws-nobl-ethos-sl-wheelset-70012?attribute_values=606%2C1763%2C1756%2C617%2C657%2C680%2C1146%2C1164%2C1523%2C1520%2C762%2C1618%2C1620%2C1734\" target=\"_blank\">noblwheels.com</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>","author":"Zach Overholt","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/nobl-ethos-sl-mtb-wheelset-is-1079g-with-tape-valves-and-its-not-even-their-lightest/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"e7cb4505009a94f8ee3cb2bd79e7dbdc833ac55a964e71f3d9019edf7d55efec","category":"Cycling"}